     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/ee4492cbfdc0940dd2636400c22210589540a921#fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/access/defaultdisseminator/DefaultDisseminatorImpl.java\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/ee4492cbfdc0940dd2636400c22210589540a921#fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/access/defaultdisseminator/DefaultDisseminatorImpl.java</a></p>\n\n<p>is the only change to that class I can see for months, and doesn't look like it would change anything.  How is the HTML broken?</p>",
