     "body": "<p>Refactoring to re-use the REST serializers for these two methods.  There are other methods here that should probably be worked into a standard serialization package (see \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-936\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-936\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Move API serializers into a separate package\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-936\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n) - not sure if these other serializations are provided by the REST API, and as they are not causing problems I am leaving alone for the moment.</p>",
